//! Differential testing infrastructure for TML type inference.
//!
//! Tests that the TML inference engine produces the same types as expected
//! for representative code patterns. Full differential comparison against
//! the C++ backend (item 6.2) requires serializing the TypeEnv from both
//! backends and comparing; this file provides the framework and initial
//! test cases.
//!
//! Phase 14c — items 6.1, 6.2 (infrastructure + initial cases).

